{"version":1,"content":"<p>剛於本月迎接44歲的日本女星深田恭子，經歷罹患適應障礙而停工後，近年一直養尊處優，工作量不多。</p><p>臨尾年尾，恭子例牌再推出月曆迎接新一年。</p><p>月曆分掛牆版及座枱版，往年均以性感造型上陣的她，2027年的月曆卻相當錫身，收起事業線，轉玩露背又大晒纖腰</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-27T06:23:53.318518+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":122,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-27T06:10:55+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-27T06:17:13.410137+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-27T06:17:13.410137+00:00","content_hash":"da35c8ebaf9bdc8b710e816bec7db22142a1c25b4a48495f324d8f0777d181c0","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}